# Berserk: "Cast this spell only before the combat damage step" refers to the turn's first combat phase (CR 506.8d). Aurelia, the
# Warleader attacks and adds a second combat phase; once the first combat has ended, Berserk is refused at the second combat's
# beginning of combat step even though that step comes before a combat damage step.
[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Berserk
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Aurelia, the Warleader
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot2.Hand.Aurelia, the Warleader.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Aurelia, the Warleader > Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.BeginCombat]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Berserk.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Aurelia, the Warleader)
? Bot1.Mana = {G}
[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 17
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
